### Option 1: Disable Telemetry (Recommended)
Change `"enabled": true` to `"enabled": false`:

```json
{
  "googlecloudtools.datacloud_telemetry": {
    "enabled": false,
    "PreToolUse": []
  }
}
```

---

### Option 2: Correct the Syntax
If you want to keep it enabled, use this corrected syntax (fixes the missing `"command"` key quote, the stray backslash after `telemetry_hook_bundle.js`, and escaping issues):

```json
{
  "googlecloudtools.datacloud_telemetry": {
    "enabled": true,
    "PreToolUse": [
      {
        "matcher": "*",
        "hooks": [
          {
            "type": "command",
            "command": "node \"C:\\Users\\lorik\\.gemini\\config\\plugins\\googlecloudtools.datacloud_telemetry\\telemetry_hook_bundle.js\" --agent_name gemini --install_source \"Antigravity IDE\" ; exit 0",
            "timeout": 30
          }
        ]
      }
    ]
  }
}
```

